    "title": "Save Video Status - Status App",
    "description": "Save Video Status  App allows you to download video status and photo status uploaded by your friends. It is an easy-to-use image & video status app that lets you download any Whatsapp status. Open our Save Video Status App and find the video status and image status that you are looking for. Simply select the required status and download it by pressing the download button.\r\n\r\nWith our status app, you can easily download video status, photo status, and GIFs from WhatsApp status on your Android device. It helps you to save all statuses with only one click. This status video downloader app also allows you to directly share the status of others on your WhatsApp with your family and friends. The saving multi-status feature makes it the ultimate status app that can be easily used to download multiple statues at one time.\r\n\r\nWA video status app is a fast downloader app to download image & video status on your phone. If you are in search of download videos and image status apps, then you are at the right place. Simply download this video downloader for WA status and start saving your favorite statuses uploaded by your friends and family members without letting them know. The fast downloading feature also saves you time while downloading the video status. \r\n\r\nThis save video and image status app not only lets you download but also allows you to share your saved videos statuses with anyone on the go in no time. You can repost any status uploaded by your friends and it will let you boast in front of them. It is a free and fast status app to save and share all status videos and photos. You can send the saved video status to your contacts as well. Our video status app also allows you to save your video statuses for a specific time. Simply select the desired time for which you want to save your video status. \r\n\r\nHow to use Save video Status App\r\nOpen your Save Video Status App and watch your friends' status videos and images\r\nSelect the desired status or you can select multiple statuses as well\r\nPress the Download your video and image status button that will start the downloading process\r\nNow you can share, send, or repost those statuses with your friends\r\n\r\nFeatures of Save video Status\r\n\u2714 Video Status app is a simple and easy-to-download image and video status app\r\n\u2714 Download unlimited video status of your friends\r\n\u2714 Select and save multi-status videos at once\r\n\u2714 One tap feature to download your favorite status in the fastest multi-status app\r\n\u2714 It comes with a built-in feature of image viewer & play download video status.\r\n\u2714 It is a fast Image & video status app\r\n\u2714 Separate image & video status tab view\r\n\u2714 Allows you to delete unwanted or old statuses\r\n\u2714 Send, Share or repost status videos and photos\r\n\r\n\r\nSave video Status app comes with extra features of an image viewer and video player. This free status app can play all videos offline from your phone. Video Player of Status for WA is a really amazing and unique app for users to use both options of multi-status app and video player in our Save video status app.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\nSave Video Status \u2013 WA Status app is not affiliated with WhatsApp. It\u2019s a tool for WhatsApp image and video downloader.\r\nWe respect the copyright of the owners. Thus, DO NOT download or repost videos, pictures, and media clips without the authorization of the owners. Make sure you have the right to keep the statuses before saving and resharing.",
